## 2-Nov-10:00pm-PST/PDT — cold test, re-pinned

The cold-test card (7:35pm) pins its links and its throwaway
build to 22bfeedf (3.15.127). That tree predates the
read-back fixes, the hold text of Section 10.3, the
held-result fixes, and the final pass. The pin moves to
77a39e51 or later: the rendered `.txt` handed to the fresh
chat is the one at that commit
(https://github.com/Pigeon-Home/homing-pigeon/blob/77a39e51c81895c7907639f749452bd829549c9d/docs/ietf/draft-slutsky-homing-pigeon-v3-00.txt),
and `PROTOCOL.md` with it
(https://github.com/Pigeon-Home/homing-pigeon/blob/77a39e51c81895c7907639f749452bd829549c9d/PROTOCOL.md).

The card's no-restart guard stated its reason as the cookie
secret dying with the process and the hold living in memory.
Both are fixed in code and verified (the cookie key is kept
in the channel; the hold is a sidecar on disk), so that
