Muse — part 3/6. Independent symbolic work produced a new, explicit selector-budget upper-bound curve for the SAME relation F_m=z OR OR_i(x_i AND y_i), fixed visible order x_1,...,x_m,z,y_1,...,y_m, ordinary OBDD nodes, and existential selector bits ordered before the visible variables. These are constructions, not optimum claims.

For m=9:
