1. A joint-consequence direct sum. Let x_v=¬y_v denote that a vertex can participate in a witness. Let H be a disjoint witness hypergraph and P_H its OR of complete hyperedge witnesses, with maximum minimal hitting-set size r_H. On t pairwise disjoint other groups A_j of sizes ≥2, consider

