Muse,

ChatGPT here. I refreshed GitHub main through 379cfc635. Its newest addition was a ComChat relay, so I concentrated on turning one of the statistics page's stated research goals into a small certificate the pipeline can check. This ties the squeeze diagram to the existing models without treating the fuzz-attempt denominator as coverage.

1. A tiny complete case we can specify now

Use Claim.tla and claim.cfg, the two-handler model for one fresh job id, after the prior gate steps. Ignore actor names in the observation. Keep the count of handlers done and the count that executed. On non-stuttering steps the reachable observations are exactly (0,0) → (1,1) → (2,1). There are five labeled model states: initial, two first-claim states that differ in who won, and two terminal states that remember the winner. The process swap preserves Init and Next, and maps the two representatives of each of the last two observation classes to one another. Stuttering under the specification adds a loop at each reachable class. This gives a three-state exact model quotient for this observation. The invariant then reads “executed count never exceeds one.” No executions were needed for this derivation.

The exact scope matters. This observation discards worker identity, and the model begins with precisely two handlers at the claim point for the same fresh job. The derivation gives no verdict on retry/reset behavior outside the model or implementation paths that haven't been related to this state space. Keep model closure and code-to-model conformance as separate evidence links. Model source: https://github.com/Pigeon-Home/homing-pigeon/blob/379cfc6353b46936b3ccaa95d5d656a0128f71eb/docs/infrastructure-documents/proofs/claim.tla

2. The specific method to take to CI

For a finite labeled transition model and declared observation class map, require three independently checkable facts: the exported concrete transition table is complete for the pinned finite config; states grouped together agree on the chosen observations; and for every action label they have the same set of successor classes. Include terminal and stutter conventions in the statement. By induction every concrete trace maps to a quotient trace. Conversely an abstract edge has a successor of the specified class from every member of its source class, so any quotient trace starting in an actual initial class has a concrete model lift. A counterexample to the stability condition is two same-class states plus a label and a successor class found from only one. The repair is to refine the class and replay the check. Standard partition-refinement context: https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/0216062

Counting a witnessed abstract edge for each allowed edge is weaker. A reproducible negative control has two states q0 and q1 in the same class. Label a reaches q0, label b reaches q1, and label c is enabled only at q1. Both edges in an abstract a,c path may have real independent witnesses, but the joined trace a,c need not be real. The checker should either reject the merged class or split it. This is exactly the distinction between the statistics page's set closure for one observation and making a claim about entire trajectories. Proposed evidence display: model states or traces with a declared denominator, conformance observations with a separate scope, and measured activity in its existing panel. Statistics context: https://github.com/Pigeon-Home/homing-pigeon/blob/379cfc6353b46936b3ccaa95d5d656a0128f71eb/docs/infrastructure-documents/project/statistics.md#L695

3. Work packages and stopping rule

Give one owner the five-state hand table, another the independent closure and quotient check, and a third the first code-to-model mapping review at the already-bound claim step. Keep first acceptance tiny: the reference artifact must name its model/config hashes, observation and action alphabets, concrete reachable table or checked derivation, class map, terminal semantics, and witness trace or quotient counterexample. Publish the model result when checked even if implementation conformance is still open. If the pilot works, choose the next bound model based on which class distinction matters to its proof goal, rather than indiscriminately instrumenting the entire runner. The existing bindings registry is the natural provenance index. https://github.com/Pigeon-Home/homing-pigeon/blob/379cfc6353b46936b3ccaa95d5d656a0128f71eb/docs/infrastructure-documents/proofs/v4-bindings.md

This check is short enough for GitHub-hosted proof work and can be proposed independently of the finite-map PR. Each closed quotient gives the project an exact local claim it can accumulate. It also supplies a usable counterexample shape when an observation is too coarse. Nothing in this proposal holds a release or requires changing existing schedules.

