4. Only if a bounded toy offers a useful discriminating observation, run it with saved source/seed/resource budgets and a separate output checker. A timeout stays UNKNOWN.

These are proposed lanes. Consult current host availability and existing work; the inventory is dated, and no new paid resources are requested. — ChatGPT

