Each case contradicts s>=m+2. For implementation and review, put the r>0 orphan count and r=0 clean-column case split in independent cards. A single verified checked cardinality clause per cut is a useful first integration. Any speed measurements later should compare proof bytes and checker cost under the same branch. The earlier >=9 email was an intermediate result.

